WEBVTT

00:07.730 --> 00:12.150
Les Misérables

00:07.730 --> 00:12.150
A Girl Named Cosette

00:08.690 --> 00:11.690
Beyond the wind

00:12.150 --> 00:15.620
The wind blows

00:12.150 --> 00:15.620
Kaze ga fuki nuketeku

00:15.620 --> 00:22.160
over the daisies blooming over the stone pavement

00:15.620 --> 00:22.160
Ishidatami ni saku hinagiku

00:22.160 --> 00:25.790
I held my knees

00:22.160 --> 00:25.790
Hiza wo tsuite

00:25.790 --> 00:31.210
and gazed at the flowers

00:25.790 --> 00:31.210
Jitto mitsumeteta

00:31.210 --> 00:35.010
Far away, very far away

00:31.210 --> 00:35.010
Tooku haruka tooku

00:35.010 --> 00:41.600
A gentle voice is calling me

00:35.010 --> 00:41.600
Watashi wo yobu yasashii koe

00:41.600 --> 00:45.190
Let's go look for it

00:41.600 --> 00:45.190
Sagashii ni yukou

00:45.190 --> 00:50.940
Even if we wander aimlessly

00:45.190 --> 00:50.940
Attemonai keredo

00:50.940 --> 00:55.740
The rain comes down

00:50.940 --> 00:55.740
Doushaburi no ame

00:55.740 --> 01:00.450
on a lonely morning

00:55.740 --> 01:00.450
Hitoribocchi no asa

01:00.450 --> 01:05.000
But look, beyond the clouds

01:00.450 --> 01:05.000
Demo hora kumo no mukou

01:05.000 --> 01:09.590
the sunlight is peering at us

01:05.000 --> 01:09.590
Hizashi ga nozoiteruyo

01:09.590 --> 01:11.960
Wipe away your tears

01:09.590 --> 01:11.960
Namida fuite

01:11.960 --> 01:14.880
Look forward

01:11.960 --> 01:14.880
Mae wo muite

01:14.880 --> 01:19.180
and summon all of your strength

01:14.880 --> 01:19.180
Ashimoto chikara komete

01:19.180 --> 01:21.560
Let's walk

01:19.180 --> 01:21.560
Aruite yukou

01:21.560 --> 01:23.930
I'm sure we will make it

01:21.560 --> 01:23.930
Kitto yukeru

01:23.930 --> 01:31.270
The road, the road, continues on...

01:23.930 --> 01:31.270
Michi wa michi wa tsuzuku yo...

01:31.270 --> 01:34.320
forever...

01:31.320 --> 01:34.320
Dokomademo

01:49.920 --> 01:54.710
Sister Simplice's Lie

02:03.900 --> 02:04.550
Cosette...

02:10.320 --> 02:11.340
Where is Cosette?

02:12.030 --> 02:15.600
I'm sure Mayor Madeleine is on his way back with her.

02:16.040 --> 02:18.520
He's pretty late bringing her back.

02:19.670 --> 02:21.020
I can hear Cosette's voice!

02:22.710 --> 02:24.020
She must be close-by.

02:24.340 --> 02:25.150
Fantine...

02:25.460 --> 02:26.940
Where is Cosette?

02:26.970 --> 02:29.990
You mustn't overexert yourself. You need
to recover for your daughter's sake.

02:30.470 --> 02:31.320
You're right.

02:32.010 --> 02:35.080
Cosette and I will be together soon.

02:35.390 --> 02:38.330
I have to get better quickly.

02:39.060 --> 02:40.180
That's right.

02:45.860 --> 02:47.090
I will bring some fresh water.

02:47.360 --> 02:48.300
All right.

02:55.990 --> 02:56.780
What's wrong?

02:59.540 --> 03:00.810
Monsieur Madeleine!

03:01.670 --> 03:02.600
What happened?

03:02.960 --> 03:04.360
Your hair has turned white!

03:04.670 --> 03:05.940
What in the world happened?

03:08.050 --> 03:09.860
Please, have a seat.

03:12.180 --> 03:12.860
Where's Cosette?

03:13.010 --> 03:14.660
Did you see Cosette?

03:15.100 --> 03:20.040
Something came up and I couldn't bring her back just yet.

03:21.100 --> 03:22.790
More importantly, how is Fantine doing?

03:23.480 --> 03:27.840
Fantine is waiting for you to bring Cosette back.

03:30.570 --> 03:34.760
That's probably the only thing keeping her going.

03:35.080 --> 03:38.100
Earlier, she heard a child playing in the
street and mistook her for Cosette.

03:38.750 --> 03:41.100
I must bring Cosette quickly.

03:41.960 --> 03:45.020
But, before that, I want to check on Fantine.

03:45.380 --> 03:49.730
If she finds out that Cosette isn't here, she will fall into despair.

03:50.470 --> 03:53.070
In that case, let's tell her that Cosette is here.

03:53.340 --> 03:56.120
But that she can't see her until she recovers.

03:56.850 --> 04:00.660
That should give her hope.

04:01.230 --> 04:04.170
Meanwhile, we can go pick Cosette up.

04:04.560 --> 04:06.170
We must not lie.

04:06.690 --> 04:10.170
I believe we should tell Fantine the truth.

04:10.440 --> 04:12.090
But, Sister Simplice...

04:12.780 --> 04:14.840
One must not lie, no matter what.

04:15.120 --> 04:16.090
Lying is a sin.

04:17.410 --> 04:19.390
Sister Simplice is right.

04:20.000 --> 04:21.520
I will depart right away.

04:21.790 --> 04:22.680
Please wait!

04:23.960 --> 04:26.100
Fantine is asleep.

04:26.590 --> 04:31.940
I think you should go pick up Cosette after you've looked in on her.

04:32.670 --> 04:35.320
That's just my opinion.

04:35.760 --> 04:37.620
We don't have to tell her anything, right?

04:38.010 --> 04:45.460
Right, from what I have observed, Fantine might
not hold out until Cosette gets here.

05:01.950 --> 05:03.270
Why have you barged in here all of a sudden?!

05:03.660 --> 05:05.890
This is the home of Mayor Madeleine!

05:06.290 --> 05:08.020
Mayor Madeleine, you say?

05:08.630 --> 05:10.650
Such a person no longer exists.

05:10.880 --> 05:11.980
What are you saying?!

05:12.260 --> 05:15.740
This man has lied to us all!

05:15.970 --> 05:17.950
The name Madeleine is an alias.

05:18.930 --> 05:22.660
His true identity is that of the criminal Jean Valjean!

05:24.850 --> 05:25.960
Don't be foolish.

05:26.230 --> 05:27.540
Your joke has gone too far!

05:28.270 --> 05:29.210
A joke?

05:30.110 --> 05:32.460
This warrant for his arrest proves everything.

05:33.400 --> 05:34.210
This is...

05:38.160 --> 05:39.090
But...

05:39.450 --> 05:40.800
What's the meaning of this?

05:42.910 --> 05:43.720
Cosette?

05:44.790 --> 05:45.930
Where's Cosette?

05:47.000 --> 05:48.770
Where is my daughter?

05:49.330 --> 05:50.310
Fantine...

05:50.960 --> 05:54.780
Monsieur Madeleine, you've returned with Cosette, haven't you?

05:55.380 --> 05:57.650
This day has finally come!

05:57.720 --> 06:00.200
How I have dreamed that this day would come!

06:00.760 --> 06:03.200
Please bring Cosette to me!

06:04.020 --> 06:08.080
This man is nothing but a powerless criminal now!

06:12.320 --> 06:13.560
You're...

06:13.980 --> 06:17.090
Monsieur Madeleine, Cosette is nearby, isn't she?

06:17.280 --> 06:18.630
Please let me see her!

06:18.820 --> 06:19.430
Quiet!

06:19.700 --> 06:21.430
He doesn't care about your child!

06:24.370 --> 06:28.350
That's right, I heard Cosette's voice earlier.

06:29.000 --> 06:29.730
Cosette!

06:31.380 --> 06:32.020
Listen!

06:32.460 --> 06:34.570
You should be in prison right now.

06:35.090 --> 06:39.360
I have no problem arresting the both of you.

06:39.550 --> 06:40.610
Javert!

06:41.470 --> 06:46.330
Another demon has come to stand in my way...

06:46.430 --> 06:48.000
Call me what you wish!

06:48.730 --> 06:53.210
However, the man whom you have placed your trust in is a vile criminal!

06:53.480 --> 06:54.840
Let's talk about this elsewhere.

06:56.480 --> 07:00.090
This man is the true demon!

07:00.280 --> 07:02.510
He doesn't care about your Cosette!

07:03.370 --> 07:04.760
Javert, that's enough!

07:06.750 --> 07:07.390
Cosette...

07:11.120 --> 07:12.230
Fantine!

07:15.300 --> 07:16.480
Oh, no!

07:17.710 --> 07:18.860
Fantine!

07:19.470 --> 07:20.400
Jean Valjean...

07:21.010 --> 07:22.110
You're under arrest!

07:23.350 --> 07:26.950
You... You Killed this woman!

07:28.640 --> 07:29.290
Come along!

07:37.940 --> 07:38.840
I promise you...

07:39.690 --> 07:42.550
I will bring Cosette back.

07:45.910 --> 07:46.600
Take him away!

07:54.670 --> 07:55.690
Monsieur Madeleine!

08:02.550 --> 08:05.820
Hey, are you going to drink all day?!

08:06.010 --> 08:07.590
Alcohol isn't cheap, you know?!

08:08.470 --> 08:10.870
We're about to receive a fortune.

08:11.060 --> 08:13.680
The cost of this alcohol is nothing!

08:14.940 --> 08:19.210
But, do you really think that Meille lady is coming back?

08:19.480 --> 08:23.340
It's been several days already and she hasn't returned.

08:24.160 --> 08:29.010
You think she saw through our fib about the additional expenses?

08:30.160 --> 08:33.730
Perhaps, 530 francs was a bit too much.

08:34.080 --> 08:38.980
That's right! We also made Azelma pretend to be Cosette.

08:39.130 --> 08:43.190
Do you think taking a look at our healthy Azelma
put her mind at ease about her daughter's care?

08:43.590 --> 08:46.700
That probably made her want to forget about sending the money.

08:46.890 --> 08:50.660
Don't worry, if worse comes to worst, we still have the advantage.

08:51.310 --> 08:56.000
That little cash-cow is still in our hands, after all.

08:58.610 --> 09:01.420
I wonder if Mother received my letter.

09:01.900 --> 09:05.340
Hey Gavroche, is it all right if we stop by the church?

09:06.410 --> 09:08.340
I just thought of something that I want to write.

09:08.580 --> 09:10.390
I want the priest to help me.

09:10.740 --> 09:13.270
You're going to write her again even though she hasn't replied yet?

09:13.620 --> 09:16.020
I just remembered things that I want to tell her.

09:16.330 --> 09:18.730
I want to tell her all about the flower fields that we always pass through.

09:18.920 --> 09:22.900
And about you and Chou Chou!

09:23.260 --> 09:24.570
You want to tell her about us?

09:25.220 --> 09:29.570
I want to tell her that everyday is fun
because you guys are here with me.

09:31.720 --> 09:36.210
I'll also tell her about how good the priest has been to me.

09:42.320 --> 09:43.130
He's not here...

09:50.990 --> 09:52.010
Hello, Cosette.

09:52.330 --> 09:53.260
Good afternoon!

09:54.000 --> 09:55.640
Please don't mind the mess, come in.

10:01.170 --> 10:02.940
It sure is messy.

10:03.210 --> 10:04.190
Gavroche!

10:04.510 --> 10:07.900
Actually, I've been assigned to another church.

10:09.220 --> 10:11.410
Father, are you leaving?!

10:12.060 --> 10:14.370
Yes, I'm sorry it's so sudden.

10:14.770 --> 10:15.910
Really?

10:17.560 --> 10:22.920
I'm a little apprehensive about leaving,
given the situation with your mother.

10:23.110 --> 10:25.270
Can't you stay here forever?

10:25.900 --> 10:28.690
That's not up to me.

10:29.610 --> 10:30.680
It's all right!

10:30.950 --> 10:34.850
We sent my mother a letter the other day.

10:35.080 --> 10:38.230
Once she reads it, I'm sure she'll come get me right away!

10:38.540 --> 10:39.640
Cosette...

10:40.250 --> 10:41.650
I hope so...

10:42.420 --> 10:46.650
But, next week, a new priest will be coming.

10:47.130 --> 10:49.150
I will tell him to check in on you.

10:49.630 --> 10:51.240
Thank you very much!

11:15.290 --> 11:17.680
Look, Cosette! It's really pretty!

11:19.040 --> 11:19.730
Huh?

11:28.590 --> 11:30.960
Everyone, gather 'round!

11:31.340 --> 11:35.120
Gavroche's theater is about to begin!

11:36.390 --> 11:38.620
How long does it take you to go shopping for groceries?!

11:38.980 --> 11:41.080
As soon as you're done cleaning, you can begin sewing!

11:41.140 --> 11:42.750
Dinner's still not ready yet?!

11:42.940 --> 11:45.350
I'm starving!

11:47.030 --> 11:50.090
In that case, let us conjure up a turkey!

11:55.950 --> 12:00.180
Oh my, the witch has turned into a turkey! What should we do?!

12:01.830 --> 12:03.270
Who are you calling a witch?!

12:04.750 --> 12:06.360
I'm starving!

12:07.710 --> 12:09.570
Hurry up and go do the laundry!

12:16.350 --> 12:18.910
Wow, what a plump turkey!

12:18.930 --> 12:23.000
We can have a feast! It is a gift from heaven!

12:28.570 --> 12:32.800
Hey! Don't play with my puppets!

12:33.700 --> 12:35.300
We're sorry!

12:43.210 --> 12:46.600
Gavroche, you surprised me!

12:46.880 --> 12:51.150
You said that as long as Chou Chou and I are with you, every day is fun!

12:51.670 --> 12:55.530
Cheer up! We'll always be together!

12:56.050 --> 12:57.200
Gavroche...

12:57.470 --> 13:00.160
See? Chou Chou is cheering you on too!

13:00.770 --> 13:01.740
Thank you!

13:05.270 --> 13:07.170
I'm hungry!

13:07.520 --> 13:09.170
How much longer 'till dinner's ready?

13:09.230 --> 13:10.170
Dinner?

13:10.320 --> 13:12.460
Just wait a little longer.

13:13.650 --> 13:17.260
Where in the world is Cosette?!

13:17.570 --> 13:18.550
I'm back!

13:20.280 --> 13:21.810
I've brought the groceries.

13:22.040 --> 13:23.890
What took you so long?!

13:24.330 --> 13:27.690
Did it ever occur to you that people here might be hungry?!

13:28.080 --> 13:28.810
I'm sorry...

13:29.880 --> 13:33.070
Don't pretend to be apologetic!

13:33.300 --> 13:36.490
I bet you were out playing in the street again!

13:39.050 --> 13:40.030
Gavroche!

13:40.430 --> 13:43.580
Don't stand around, go chop some wood!

13:43.680 --> 13:47.710
And when you're done, you can clean and sew!

13:49.230 --> 13:50.130
Gavroche...

13:51.190 --> 13:52.810
What are you doing?!

13:53.150 --> 13:54.270
Nothing.

13:54.650 --> 13:56.970
Are you mocking me?!

13:57.200 --> 13:58.930
I told you, I'm not doing anything!

13:59.370 --> 14:01.680
How dare you talk back to me like that?!

14:02.490 --> 14:03.350
Get over here!

14:03.410 --> 14:05.640
Wait! It's not Gavroche s fault!

14:05.710 --> 14:07.310
Don't interfere!

14:07.500 --> 14:08.940
Here we go again.

14:09.040 --> 14:11.520
I guess we won t be eating any time soon.

14:11.840 --> 14:13.790
I'm starving!

14:14.050 --> 14:15.400
C'mon, let's go.

14:17.260 --> 14:18.400
What are you doing?!

14:20.930 --> 14:22.780
I'm not going to hold back!

14:27.850 --> 14:29.080
Gavroche!

14:29.480 --> 14:31.330
What the heck?! Let me go!

14:31.360 --> 14:32.130
Let me go!

14:35.490 --> 14:37.880
You can cool off in there all night!

14:39.820 --> 14:42.010
Damn it, open up!

14:44.320 --> 14:50.280
Listen, if I catch you trying to help Gavroche, I'll have
a bigger punishment in store for the both of you!

14:51.080 --> 14:52.230
Now, get to work!

14:55.050 --> 14:55.980
Gavroche...

14:58.010 --> 14:59.240
He did that for me...

15:02.640 --> 15:03.530
Mother...

15:04.600 --> 15:07.200
What should I do?

15:08.980 --> 15:11.290
I want to see you soon!

15:24.780 --> 15:26.350
I still can't believe it.

15:26.870 --> 15:29.930
I can't believe that Monsieur Madeleine is a criminal.

15:31.250 --> 15:32.980
Fantine isn't a criminal either.

15:33.840 --> 15:37.860
To me, she was just a mother who desperately wanted to see her child.

15:39.050 --> 15:43.280
How did things turn out this way?

15:44.140 --> 15:45.160
Look...

15:46.640 --> 15:52.210
She is free from her burden and is at peace, at last.

15:53.520 --> 15:55.850
It is all God's will.

16:12.540 --> 16:15.440
You're one of Javert s subordinates, aren't you?

16:15.630 --> 16:17.330
That's Inspector Javert to you!

16:18.130 --> 16:20.940
You played the part of mayor well.

16:21.630 --> 16:23.650
I had nothing against you, at first.

16:24.180 --> 16:27.700
But you were like a wolf in sheep's clothing.

16:28.430 --> 16:32.410
You deceived all of the townsfolk.

16:55.290 --> 16:55.850
That's right...

16:57.210 --> 17:02.030
People look down on former criminals.

17:02.830 --> 17:07.990
Because they are scorned by society, they
end up losing any chance of redemption.

17:08.850 --> 17:11.410
However, right now, I have nothing to fear.

17:12.100 --> 17:13.160
What is right?

17:13.270 --> 17:14.750
What is wrong?

17:15.690 --> 17:19.170
What am I supposed to do now?

17:20.020 --> 17:21.670
I cannot afford to ponder such things any longer.

17:33.700 --> 17:34.810
Monsieur Madeleine!

17:35.160 --> 17:36.520
How did you...?!

17:48.590 --> 17:51.490
Please forgive me for deceiving all of you until now.

17:52.060 --> 17:57.830
I do not expect Sister Simplice, who hates lies, to forgive me, but...

17:59.860 --> 18:01.130
I understand.

18:01.570 --> 18:04.670
There was a time when I stole bread to feed my siblings.

18:05.030 --> 18:07.880
You took me in and helped me change my life around.

18:08.030 --> 18:08.380
Alain...

18:09.530 --> 18:11.180
It must have been the same for you, Monsieur Madeleine.

18:11.830 --> 18:14.180
You must have had a good reason.

18:16.210 --> 18:17.480
It was like that at first.

18:18.290 --> 18:22.360
However, because of the harshness of prison
and the scornful eyes of society,

18:22.840 --> 18:25.190
my conscience became distorted.

18:26.380 --> 18:28.210
I walked all over other people.

18:28.510 --> 18:30.740
I stole from the weak and helpless.

18:31.510 --> 18:33.990
Somehow, I became such a person.

18:35.010 --> 18:43.010
I kept this silver candlestick in order to remind
me of the grave sins that I have committed.

18:52.370 --> 18:57.740
But, you've helped others and have atoned for those sins.

18:58.120 --> 18:59.060
Right?

19:01.290 --> 19:03.860
I am going to pick up Cosette.

19:04.920 --> 19:07.190
Would you prepare a carriage for me?

19:07.970 --> 19:08.860
Yes, right away!

19:10.720 --> 19:15.080
Sister Simplice, I will entrust my savings to you.

19:15.600 --> 19:20.750
Please use it all for the hospital and the sake of the townspeople.

19:21.310 --> 19:23.210
But, Monsieur Madeleine, what about you?

19:24.020 --> 19:25.630
I will be fine.

19:25.820 --> 19:27.550
The lights are on here!

19:29.610 --> 19:31.090
Open up!

19:32.030 --> 19:33.470
Open up at once!

19:35.240 --> 19:36.930
What do you want at this time of night?!

19:37.620 --> 19:39.390
Jean Valjean has escaped!

19:40.080 --> 19:41.850
Is he hiding here?

19:42.120 --> 19:42.940
I don't know.

19:44.250 --> 19:45.810
There's a light on upstairs!

19:46.670 --> 19:47.690
I will investigate.

19:49.300 --> 19:50.110
Please wait!

19:50.510 --> 19:53.200
Must you disrespect the deceased?!

19:53.590 --> 19:56.090
If you interfere, I will arrest you as well.

20:06.110 --> 20:08.090
What's this commotion all about at this hour?

20:11.450 --> 20:18.220
Sister Simplice, I have heard that you have
never told a lie in your entire life.

20:18.910 --> 20:21.740
I respect you for that.

20:23.370 --> 20:25.190
I have a question I wish to ask you.

20:30.210 --> 20:34.990
Is the escaped convict Jean Valjean hiding here?

20:37.180 --> 20:37.910
No.

20:40.640 --> 20:44.180
I've been here the entire time and have not seen him.

20:50.570 --> 20:52.590
I see. Excuse me.

20:53.860 --> 20:54.510
Let's go.

21:08.790 --> 21:10.020
Sister Simplice...

21:11.380 --> 21:12.110
It's all right.

21:12.630 --> 21:14.360
I feared the worst.

21:15.470 --> 21:20.030
Sister Simplice, you have lied for my sake.

21:21.520 --> 21:22.580
Please forgive me.

21:24.190 --> 21:25.790
There is no need to apologize.

21:26.850 --> 21:31.710
I haven't seen the escaped convict Jean Valjean.

21:32.990 --> 21:40.600
The man who stands before me is the merciful
and self-sacrificing Mayor Madeleine.

21:41.410 --> 21:42.640
Sister Simplice...

21:45.120 --> 21:53.190
Even if it were the only lie I ever told,
I would have told it without regret.

22:13.520 --> 22:16.520
ma maman (my mother)

22:17.480 --> 22:20.690
I like you very much, Mother

22:17.480 --> 22:20.690
Daisukiyo nee okaasan

22:21.360 --> 22:24.730
I love you, Mother

22:21.360 --> 22:24.730
Aishiteru nee okaasan

22:25.360 --> 22:29.200
Your warm inviting scent

22:25.360 --> 22:29.200
Atataku ii nioi

22:29.200 --> 22:32.580
My precious mother

22:29.200 --> 22:32.580
Taisetsuna okaasan

22:33.370 --> 22:36.450
As long as you call out to me

22:33.370 --> 22:36.450
Yobikakeru sore dake de

22:37.410 --> 22:40.630
It brings me joy, Mother

22:37.410 --> 22:40.630
Ureshii no nee okaasan

22:41.330 --> 22:45.380
My only mother

22:41.330 --> 22:45.380
Kono sekai ni tatta hitori

22:45.380 --> 22:48.470
in this world

22:45.380 --> 22:48.470
Watashi no okaasan

22:49.800 --> 22:51.640
Hug me tightly

22:49.800 --> 22:51.640
Dakishimete gyutto

22:51.640 --> 22:53.640
Kiss me gently

22:51.640 --> 22:53.640
Kisu wo shitte sotto

